  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Literacy for 1500 Children At Home</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Early Literacy lasts a lifetime&quot; is the slogan to drive our July Bonus Day with Global Giving.   South Africa is currently facing a huge literacy challenge, with 78% of 10 year old children unable to read with meaning.     This project will provide books for the children as well as host language and literacy workshops for parents, who receive little emotional support and advice on what they can do to give their child a start in life.</narrative>
  </description>
